# Gemini environment example

Create a .env.local file with the following values (do NOT commit secrets):

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_API_URL=https://api.example.com/v1/your-gemini-endpoint

# Example (Google/Vertex-like):
# GEMINI_API_URL=https://us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1/projects/PROJECT/locations/LOCATION/publishers/google/models/MODEL:predict

The server routes added:
- app/api/gemini/route.ts  (app router)
- pages/api/gemini.ts      (pages router fallback)

Use the GeminiDemo component to call /api/gemini from the client.
